WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.535
-This is very exciting.
You went on a global press tour

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
to promote
this season of the show.

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:08.408
-Yeah, well, you know,
Berlin, but, yes, global.

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:11.344 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
It's over ocean at least.

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:12.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-You were in Berlin.

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:14.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
I heard this was
very exciting for you.

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:16.016 size:84% position:42% line:92%
You stayed in the hotel

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:18.284 align:start size:94% position:6%
where Michael Jackson
famously dangled his child.

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:20.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Dangled the baby.
Baby Blanket.

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:23.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, baby Blanket.
-You guys know Blanket, right?

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:27.127
I mean, one of the great --
one of the top 10 baby names.

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:28.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-You're a dad, so...

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:31.598 size:84% position:42%
-Yeah, I was so upset
that Blanket was taken.

00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:32.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I can only imagine.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:35.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I mean, as soon as

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:38.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
we got there,
you know, it's me,

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:40.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
the great Danielle Brooks,
who plays Taystee.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:44.544 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She's fantastic.
-I mean, one of the greats.

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:46.579 line:92%
The wonderful Jackie Cruz.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:47.814 size:81% position:41% line:92%
And so, we were there.

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:51.951 size:84% position:42%
And I was the quirky
of the bunch, you know?

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:53.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so, right away,
as soon as we got there,

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
I said,
"Let me see this balcony."

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:56.756 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.756 --> 00:00:59.092
-You asked the hotel staff?
-Because they're very good

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:01.694 size:88% position:44%
at being, like, polite,
reasonable human beings.

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:04.130 line:92%
So it gives me the space I need

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:06.399 size:75% position:38%
to just, right away,
move in with that,

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:09.436
which I did.
-I imagine the hotel has chosen

00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:11.004 line:92%
not to promote this as a thing.

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:13.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I don't know why.
I don't know why.

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:14.074 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:14.841 line:92%
I got to be totally honest,

00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:17.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
I actually have no idea
what the name of the hotel is.

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:20.280 size:84% position:42%
I only know that it was
the baby Blanket hotel.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:20.814 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.814 --> 00:01:24.117
And if I had to get back,
I would just, you know,

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:25.118 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Google that, I guess.

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:29.456 size:81% position:41%
Oh, wonderful hotel.
Such wonderful people.

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:30.223 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:31.858 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did you ever
get to the balcony?

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:35.128 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah.
Oh, yeah, big-time, big-time.

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:35.695 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:39.032 align:start size:94% position:6%
We dangled so many things
off the balcony.

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:41.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
The whole --
The whole junket,

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:43.670 align:start size:94% position:6%
I couldn't focus
'cause I was just, like,

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:46.039
"Why aren't we doing
the whole thing on the balcony?"

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:47.307 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:48.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, yes.
-I'm so glad

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:52.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
you're bringing attention back
to that historic moment.

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:53.613
-Yeah.
It's actually -- It's messed up.

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:55.014 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because, you know,
he passed away.

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:56.950 align:start size:94% position:6%
But his ghost
still haunts those halls.

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:57.717 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Really?
-Yes, it does.

00:01:57.717 --> 00:01:58.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, that's good to know.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:01:58.985 --> 00:02:01.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
Big fan of the show.
Of "Orange is the New Black."

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:02.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, got you.
Not this one.

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:05.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
-On Netflix, yes.
-Oh, so, in the haunting,

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:08.128
he gives you --
-He loves Netflix, Michael, yes.

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:09.762 line:92%
-So, Michael Jackson's ghost

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:11.397 align:start size:94% position:6%
takes time out
to compliment your work.

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:14.334 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, he's such a great guy.
You know?

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:14.868 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:17.670
You know he has a great --
He has those little loafers

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.772 size:84% position:42%
and the white socks,
which I love, and I do.

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:22.942
-That's interesting, 'cause
I never know, as a ghost,

00:02:22.942 --> 00:02:23.977 align:start size:94% position:6%
do you still
have your old clothes?

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:27.447 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah. You have
your kind of hero life outfit,

00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:31.050
but you would maybe a suit like
this when you become a ghost.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah.
-And so, for him, it's that.

00:02:33.353 --> 00:02:35.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we talked about that,
'cause we have that in common.

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:36.923 line:92%
-Now, he didn't die there.

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:39.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
Why'd he end up
back at that hotel?

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:39.893 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:43.696
-Now that's the kind of quantum
science I don't get mixed up in.

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:45.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I apologize.
-I don't go there.

00:02:45.265 --> 00:02:47.567 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, no.
Shame on me for asking.

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:49.369 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes, yes.

